package cajeta.gpu;

/**
 * KernelArg — marker for types admissible as @Kernel parameters.
 *
 * Per CajetaXPU.md §3.1.1, @Kernel functions take only parameters
 * whose types satisfy this trait: primitives, POD structs,
 * Buffer<T>, Texture<...>, Sampler, and @PushConstant structs
 * (Vulkan only).
 *
 * v1 surfaces the trait as a marker interface. Step 3 wires the
 * typechecker validation in `src/cajeta/xpu/core/KernelArgTrait`
 * — for now, the marker exists so the validation pass has a
 * canonical name to look up. The full structural-trait check
 * (admit any POD-shape without the `@KernelArg` annotation) lands
 * after the basic round-trip works.
 */
public interface KernelArg { }
